{* The selected options in the order of the class, one per line: a <br /> only between two of them, nothing
   before, after or around a single one (portions derived from LoveStack, mugoweb/ezpublish-legacy, commits
   eee7f69fc3 and 67eec8f972, Copyright (C) Mugo Web, GPL v2). *}
{def $selected_id_array = $attribute.content
     $selection_shown = false()}
{foreach $attribute.class_content.options as $option}{if $selected_id_array|contains( $option.id )}{if $selection_shown}<br />{/if}{$option.name|wash( xhtml )}{set $selection_shown = true()}{/if}{/foreach}
{undef $selected_id_array $selection_shown}
